          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Severe energy disruptions raise domestic production costs and political pressure to shield energy‑intensive industries, prompting policymakers to adopt higher tariffs, import restrictions or selective export controls to protect domestic capacity." />
