          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising long-term yields raise corporate and consumer financing costs and lift discount rates, which dampens capex and demand for durable goods and thereby reduces semiconductor orders over the product-cycle." />
