          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising unpredictability about tariff and trade enforcement increases jurisdictional policy risk and investor uncertainty, prompting funds and corporate investors to pause or re-allocate commitments to multi-year AI infrastructure projects." />
